From a793441b2953a3cc0c47e379e833feea5d511b7b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 22 Aug 2026 19:28:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix ability score modifier table boundary (score 13 should be
 +1, not 0)

DCC_ABILITY_MOD_TABLE had the 0/+1 boundary at score 13 instead of 12,
so a 13 ability score incorrectly got no modifier instead of +1,
per Table 1-1 in the DCC core rulebook.
---
 index.html | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/index.html b/index.html
index 3773d9f..73cd1d0 100644
--- a/index.html
+++ b/index.html
@@ -5191,7 +5191,7 @@ const DCC_ABILITY_MOD_TABLE = [
   { max: 3, mod: -3 },
   { max: 5, mod: -2 },
   { max: 8, mod: -1 },
-  { max: 13, mod: 0 },
+  { max: 12, mod: 0 },
   { max: 15, mod: 1 },
   { max: 17, mod: 2 },
   { max: 19, mod: 3 },
-- 
2.43.0

